  "answerable": true,
  "answer": "Direct prompt injections occur when a user's input directly alters the model's behavior, whereas indirect prompt injections happen when an LLM processes input from external sources like websites or files that contain data designed to alter the model's behavior [S1]. Both types of injections can be intentional or unintentional [S1, S2].",
  "citations": [
    "S1",
    "S2"
  ]
}

{
  "claims": [
