    },
    {
      "claim": "Indirect prompt injections happen when an LLM processes input from external sources like websites or files that contain data designed to alter the model's behavior.",
      "supported": true,
      "evidence": "Indirect prompt injections occur when an LLM accepts input from external sources, such as websites or files. The external source may have content data that when interpreted by the model, alters the behavior of the model in unintended or unexpected ways."
    },
